  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/09/IMG_0791.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(14 fotos) El pr&oacute;ximo mi&eacute;rcoles, 21 de septiembre, Carnicer&iacute;a Rub&eacute;n reabre sus puertas en la calle del Carmen, 30 de Onda, junto al jard&iacute;n de Cervantes,&nbsp;con las mejores carnes, embutidos ib&eacute;ricos y artesanales, o hamburguesas hechas all&iacute; mismo, pero tambi&eacute;n con pan a muy buen precio, rosquilletas, papas y conservas.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenreapertura/img_0791.jpg\" alt=\"img_0791\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenreapertura/img_0792.jpg\" alt=\"img_0792\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenreapertura/img_0793.jpg\" alt=\"img_0793\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenreapertura/img_0794.jpg\" alt=\"img_0794\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenreapertura/img_0795.jpg\" alt=\"img_0795\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenreapertura/img_0796.jpg\" alt=\"img_0796\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenreapertura/img_0800.jpg\" alt=\"img_0800\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/carnisseriarubenreapertura/img_0801.jpg\" alt=\"img_0801